# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working copies of the user's real Stellaris files. NEVER commit these, and
# never edit the originals: all development reads/writes these copies only.
# See docs/file-safety.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
sandbox/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Extracted game data and baked assets, derived from a local Stellaris install
# and © Paradox Interactive.
#
# The web app's copy is committed deliberately. No hosted runner has a Stellaris
# installation, so without it in the repository the site can only ever be built
# by hand on a machine that does; with it, a push builds and publishes on its
# own. It is 173 MB across 11,800 files, and it stays that size rather than
# growing: extraction is byte-for-byte deterministic, so re-running it after an
# unrelated change produces identical files and adds nothing to history. Only a
# game update or a change to the extractor itself costs anything.
#
# The other copies are still ignored: they are scratch output of the same thing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/gamedata/
*.gamedb.json

